---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { profile, href } from '../data/profile';
---
<Layout title="About" selectedItem="about"><header><h1>About me</h1><p class="lead">I’m Emran Shafaq.</p></header><article class="prose">{profile.portrait && <img class="about-portrait" src={href(profile.portrait)} alt={`Portrait of ${profile.name}`} width="240" height="280" />}<p>My interests include fast mathematical visualizations, numerical and randomized linear algebra, unconventional computing, and high-performance computing.</p><p>Outside of these projects, I’m interested in nature and analog synthesizers. This site is also a place for personal writing.</p><h2>Background</h2><p>A fuller bio, academic background, and research experience will be added here.</p><h2>Projects & writing</h2><p>You can find my computational work on the <a href={href('projects/')}>projects page</a>, and my notes and personal posts on the <a href={href('blog/')}>blog</a>.</p>{(profile.email || profile.github || profile.cv) && <><h2>Contact & links</h2><div class="about-links">{profile.email && <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>Email ↗</a>}{profile.github && <a href={profile.github}>GitHub ↗</a>}{profile.cv && <a href={href(profile.cv)}>CV ↗</a>}</div></>}</article></Layout>
